  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Two wires each of radius <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cm</mi></math>&nbsp;and negligible mass, one made of steel and the other made of brass are loaded as shown in the figure. The elongation of the steel wire is ______<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>&#8211;</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math>. [Young&#39;s modulus for steel <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>11</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mrow><mo>&#8211;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>&#8211;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math>]</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/ab1559b6-6f14-4f79-8dac-33f1432a9aa5.png\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 227px;\" /></p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "20",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>The force acting on steel wire&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>F</mi></math> is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>14</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>14</mn><mi>g</mi></math></p><p>From the relation of Young&#39;s modulus, it can be written</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>F</mi><mi>A</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>Y</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#916;</mi><mi>L</mi></mrow><mi>L</mi></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#916;</mi><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>F</mi><mi>L</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>Y</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>14</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>g</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>11</mn></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math></p></blockquote>",
